OL,3,GNEWSAMan who murdered wife and hid body
OL,4,Aunder bed jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who murdered his wife and hid her
OL,7,Fbody under their bed has been jailed.
OL,9,FKyle Howard, 37, stabbed Keeley
OL,10,FAspinall, 44, to death in their
OL,11,FRochdale home on 23 May and hid her
OL,12,Fbody under their bed for two days
OL,13,Fbefore alerting the authorities,
OL,14,FGreater Manchester Police (GMP) said.
OL,16,FHoward was sentenced to a minimum of
OL,17,F21-and-a-half years in prison at
OL,18,FManchester Crown Court, after earlier
OL,19,Fpleading guilty to murder.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
