OL,3,GNEWSAMan who murdered wife and hid body
OL,4,Aunder bed jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a victim impact statement read to
OL,7,Fthe court, Keeley's sister said: "I
OL,8,Fhave never been so heartbroken in my
OL,9,Flife. I just wish I could have one more
OL,10,Fsecond with my sister."
